  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFH Jordan - Bridging Gaps, Nuturing Families</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Institute for Family Health (IFH) of the King Hussein Foundation (KHF) provides comprehensive services in primary healthcare such as family medicine and sexual and reproductive health. IFH&#x2019;s approach responds to the needs of the most vulnerable and provides integrated prevention, curative, protection, rehabilitation, and resilience services. IFH cooperates at different levels with national institutions and stakeholders, including the Ministries of Health, Social Development and Justice. GBV prevention and response are increasingly underfunded in a challenging development context in Jordan &#x2013; given that IFH leads national SGBV initiatives and interventions, they have emerged as an appropriate partner</narrative>
  </description>
